[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4142.07, "timestamp": "01:09:02", "text": "所以我们应该以这种方式进行调查吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4143.749, "timestamp": "01:09:03", "text": "还是反过来？你怎么认为，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4146.63, "timestamp": "01:09:06", "text": "男人？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.03, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "妈的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4150.709, "timestamp": "01:09:10", "text": "等待。你好。你好。你好。对不起。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.749, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "网络居然断了一会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4157.11, "timestamp": "01:09:17", "text": "没关系。我们走吧。菲律宾人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4158.229, "timestamp": "01:09:18", "text": "经验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4159.03, "timestamp": "01:09:19", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4161.305, "timestamp": "01:09:21", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4162.47, "timestamp": "01:09:22", "text": "我是菲律宾人 X。我的意思是，一直以来都不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4164.47, "timestamp": "01:09:24", "text": "想去。它并没有把它杀死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4166.39, "timestamp": "01:09:26", "text": "就像以前的电力一样。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4168.07, "timestamp": "01:09:28", "text": "目前只能通过互联网了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4169.749, "timestamp": "01:09:29", "text": "这是第一阶段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4175.189, "timestamp": "01:09:35", "text": "你觉得怎么样，伙计？和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4176.95, "timestamp": "01:09:36", "text": "她要扣押莲花大师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4179.189, "timestamp": "01:09:39", "text": "我觉得我们不应该调查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4184.39, "timestamp": "01:09:44", "text": "肉质区域。这似乎很危险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4187.349, "timestamp": "01:09:47", "text": "上面的其中一条路径看起来不太像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4189.669, "timestamp": "01:09:49", "text": "危险，但这是一条血腥之路。这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4194.07, "timestamp": "01:09:54", "text": "看起来像是通往……的入口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4197.03, "timestamp": "01:09:57", "text": "放到某人的鼠标上。我不太信任别人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4199.03, "timestamp": "01:09:59", "text": "两个都。所以，我们必须做出选择。"}]